        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thou hast found thyself trapped in a strange dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It seems to keep looping, no matter which exit thou taketh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To exit this wretched place, thou must choose the correct exit EIGHT times in a row!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One is for the righteous - pass through it if all appears right...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916720/extras/8ad553d7f5ec1bbd8d8bf2bf007aaa4a.avif?t=1761926423\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916720/extras_big/8ad553d7f5ec1bbd8d8bf2bf007aaa4a.avif?t=1761926423 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The other is for the deceived - choose it if thine eyes catch an anomaly...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916720/extras/225f207e52960b4c82de4dd56c05f8fd.avif?t=1761926423\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916720/extras_big/225f207e52960b4c82de4dd56c05f8fd.avif?t=1761926423 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game doth contain <strong>fourscore anomalies</strong> and more! (<strong>80+ anomalies</strong>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The anomalies do range from:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the making of things to vanish,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to appear,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or be supplanted,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unto encounters most unkindly!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thy playtime shouldst be about ONE hour!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thou hast found thyself trapped in a strange dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It seems to keep looping, no matter which exit thou taketh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To exit this wretched place, thou must choose the correct exit EIGHT times in a row!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One is for the righteous - pass through it if all appears right...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916720/extras/8ad553d7f5ec1bbd8d8bf2bf007aaa4a.avif?t=1761926423\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916720/extras_big/8ad553d7f5ec1bbd8d8bf2bf007aaa4a.avif?t=1761926423 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The other is for the deceived - choose it if thine eyes catch an anomaly...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916720/extras/225f207e52960b4c82de4dd56c05f8fd.avif?t=1761926423\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916720/extras_big/225f207e52960b4c82de4dd56c05f8fd.avif?t=1761926423 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game doth contain <strong>fourscore anomalies</strong> and more! (<strong>80+ anomalies</strong>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The anomalies do range from:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the making of things to vanish,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to appear,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or be supplanted,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unto encounters most unkindly!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thy playtime shouldst be about ONE hour!</p>",
